- `crates/argmin-s3/src/main.rs:229-241` - The main binary supports ControlPlane, StorageNode, Combined, Frontend, and LegacyLocal process roles; storage-node/combined roles are production runtime scope.
- `crates/argmin-s3/src/main.rs:540-562` - Storage-node and combined process paths bind the storage node and spawn the control-plane refresh loop when configured.
