- `crates/storage/src/storage_node_server.rs:955-1016` - The control-plane refresh thread repeatedly calls refresh_and_install_control_plane_runtime_map and waits only the configured refresh interval between attempts.
- `crates/storage/src/node.rs:1139-1158` - pg_heartbeat_observation obtains the per-PG mutex via get_pg and then calls validate_metadata_command_replay_state_preserving_pending_slot while the guard remains live.
